From 50e2af8ef27e78b492644e345ad2b3aa03c4bb15 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 17:30:56 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Weapon groups: load every weapon, keep charges when grouping,
 every launcher fires

- LoadLinkedWeapons(): load every module in the bank from the offered stacks, shared evenly when there
  aren't enough to fill them all (it loaded the master, then usually nothing, and could read past the
  end of chargeIDs).
- LinkWeapon(): loaded weapons can be grouped.  MatchLinkedCharges() gives the group one charge type
  (the master's; an empty master takes the slave's): a slave with another type is unloaded to cargo and
  reloaded from cargo.  The master is always flagged as linked master; Group All created its entry first
  and never set the flags, so the group fired as a single weapon.
- LinkWeaponLoop(): skip only loading/active weapons, not loaded ones.  UnloadOnLinkAll defaults to false.
- LaunchMissile(): every loaded, online launcher in a group launches its own missile (LaunchMissileFrom);
  Missile no longer multiplies damage, flight time and hit points by the group size.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
